2352
03:51:32,622 --> 03:51:38,244
First is the edge color argument, which allows us to specify a border color between the bars.

2353
03:51:39,086 --> 03:51:44,324
Second is the align argument, which keeps the bars consistently aligned on the x-axis.

2354
03:51:45,230 --> 03:51:47,108
Running the cell with these changes,

2355
03:51:47,822 --> 03:51:49,604
the bars are now cleanly separated,

2356
03:51:50,576 --> 03:51:53,924
