2361
03:52:08,942 --> 03:52:12,996
This function takes a list of numbers and uses exactly those as labels.

2362
03:52:13,870 --> 03:52:18,916
We build that list using range again, starting at min rest days just like before,

2363
03:52:19,950 --> 03:52:28,452
