2369
03:52:54,094 --> 03:52:58,276
Running the cell one last time, we get our finished histogram.

2370
03:52:59,214 --> 03:53:04,260
Two tall bars stand at three and four days, with just a single shorter bar at five.

2371
03:53:05,262 --> 03:53:07,364
